  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 制作的模组。用心制作。支持 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 平台的众多活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>羊毛调整（Wool Tweaks）对羊毛、床和地毯的染色进行了多项改动。现在任何颜色都可以在合成网格中染色，而不仅仅是白色变种。还可以手持染料右键点击已放置的方块，方块颜色就会随之改变。此外还包含一个将任意颜色羊毛合成为 4 根线的配方。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含在「原版体验」整合包中\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"包含在「Serilum 的生活质量合集」中\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"运行环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>手持染料右键点击世界中的任意羊毛方块即可转换颜色：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示剧透</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong>手持染料右键点击世界中的任意床即可转换颜色：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示剧透</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"560\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong>手持染料右键点击世界中的任意地毯即可转换颜色：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>显示剧透</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"562\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span><strong>将任意羊毛方块合成为 4 根线：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>为任意羊毛方块染色：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/g.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>为任意床染色：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/h.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span><strong>为任意地毯染色：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/i.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/wool-tweaks/j.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"969\" height=\"543\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以在任何整合包中自由使用本模组，但下载链接必须保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 平台内。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事宜，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
